 says the Milwaukee-Downer Room is available for individual or group study on a first-come basis when it is not otherwise in use.","source_url":"https://www.lawrence.edu/library/spaces","source_title":"Spaces in the Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use is first-come, first-served only when no academic or administrative function occupies the room; library building access requires a Lawrence card.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lawrence-mudd-lincoln-room","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Lincoln Room","title":"Take a first-come seat in the Lincoln Room","subtitle":"Flexible solo or group study between scheduled functions","notes":"Confirm the room is not reserved before unpacking, and choose it when you need a named room that can accommodate either solo or shared work.","short_summary":"An occasional-function room that doubles as a flexible study setting when open.","evidence_claim":"Lawrence states that the Lincoln Room may be used for individual or group study on a first-come basis whenever it is not otherwise in use.","source_url":"https://www.lawrence.edu/library/spaces","source_title":"Spaces in the Library","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Availability depends on academic and administrative reservations; library building access requires a Lawrence card during open hours.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lawrence-mudd-third-floor-group-room","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Mudd Library Third-Floor Group Study Room","title":"Put the problem on three different surfaces","subtitle":"A reservable group room with computer, display, and writing boards","notes":"Sign up on the clipboard at the door, bring your Lawren